  "content": "\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>❗ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>免责声明</strong></span>：本模组实质上是一个附带资源包的数据包。如需查看数据包版本，请访问 Modrinth 上的&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fvanilla-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</em></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>遇到问题或担心模组不兼容？请查阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios/backpacks/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a> 上的“⚠️ 兼容性”标签页。</em></h5>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MGcd6kTf/images/3c711eae7bf4953725bd3ddb34ca12c210915ad3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🎒 背包！</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>一款为你的游戏添加原版风格背包的数据包，支持升级、染色和自定义样式！</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"158\" height=\"56\"></em></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>^ 仅在使用 Fabric 或 Quilt 时必需</em></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🔗 链接</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EclipseStudiosMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"167\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4pYjW9btNc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252feclipse-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EclipseStudios447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/elgeroingles/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252felgeroingles%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/ElGeroIngles/860767aa976892908afff9f2c4b9648f/raw/eda5e7344a38837c32e34a1c0f8a4de180d38d5c/planet_minecraft_cozy.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">❤️ 特别感谢...</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🔧 辅助与工具...</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DefinitelyHighmore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Highmore</a> 的库 <a href=\"https://github.com/DefinitelyHighmore/sentinel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sentinel</a>，用于检测容器关闭状态（可能导致背包内物品出现视觉闪烁）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fmitsaori%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mitsaori</a> 制作的背包模型。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Evtema3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evtema3</a> 的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f154777837382008833%252f157097006500806656%252f1181814993537220658\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">着色器</a>，用于在第三人称视角下隐藏菜单的名称标签。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AmberWat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmberWat</a> 的<a href=\"https://github.com/AmberWat/NegativeSpaceFont\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Negative Space Font</a>，用于在<a href=\"https://github.com/Evtema3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evtema3</a> 的着色器中隐藏名称标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🌐 贡献者...</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>英语 (en_us)：由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 翻译。</li>\n<li>西班牙语 (es_es)：由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 翻译。</li>\n<li>巴西葡萄牙语 (pt_br)：由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/alexsanderfer\" rel=\"nofollow\">alexsanderfer</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"https://github.com/MeiaQuatru\" rel=\"nofollow\">MeiaQuatru</a> 翻译。</li>\n<li>简体中文 (zh_cn)：由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/calmastorm\" rel=\"nofollow\">calmastorm</a> 翻译。</li>\n<li>俄语 (ru_ru)：由 <a href=\"https://github.com/Akrek\" rel=\"nofollow\">Akrek</a> 翻译。</li>\n<li>欧洲葡萄牙语 (pt_pt)：由 <a href=\"https://github.com/AlexandreC2000\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlexandreC2000</a> 翻译。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>你可以通过翻译为其他语言来为本项目做出贡献！详情请见 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">📝 有用信息</span></h2>\n<p>需要了解项目的相关信息吗？请查阅全新的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios/backpacks/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>！</p>",
